{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610311939034843655778268d9d6GIIMGt4B","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_e25d8532d743461f90c6e0a7471a952d","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"async function inspectPages() {\n  const pages = figma.root.children;\n  const result = {};\n  \n  for (const page of pages) {\n    await page.loadAsync();\n    const textNodes = page.findAllWithCriteria({ types: ['TEXT'] });\n    const texts = textNodes.map(t => `${t.name}: ${t.characters}`).slice(0, 50); // limit\n    const topNodes = page.children.map(c => ({ id: c.id, name: c.name, type: c.type }));\n    result[page.name] = { id: page.id, topNodes, textSample: texts };\n  }\n  \n  return JSON.stringify(result, null, 2);\n}\nreturn await inspectPages();","description":"Inspect all pages, top-level nodes, and text content in the file.","fileKey":"UDHOIh8tFCDGiUMWd3Tt8U"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10785,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5f3b380f-f2d2-4f82-a745-b3675409a2af","uuid":"c64d21f4-8b52-44eb-a532-78314d3dec26","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:39:08.237Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_e25d8532d743461f90c6e0a7471a952d","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_e25d8532d743461f90c6e0a7471a952d","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"00 · Start Here 设计任务\": {\n    \"id\": \"0:1\",\n    \"topNodes\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"5:2\",\n        \"name\": \"Start Here · Brief\",\n        \"type\": \"FRAME\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"textSample\": [\n      \"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\n      \"Travelin — travel booking app: Travelin — travel booking app\",\n      \"Design the Travelin mobile app: open the app, start the journey, sign in, and land on a home screen with the upcoming flight, travel categories, recommended journeys and a recommended hotel. Canvas 430 × 932, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.: Design the Travelin mobile app: open the app, start the journey, sign in, and land on a home screen with the upcoming flight, travel categories, recommended journeys and a recommended hotel. Canvas 430 × 932, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\n      \"How to work: How to work\",\n      \"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, overlays on photos, status badge, rating, error / disabled), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the language selector, the tab bar and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, photos and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.: 1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, overlays on photos, status badge, rating, error / disabled), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the language selector, the tab bar and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use the logo, photos and icons from 04 · Media.\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\n      \"Frames · goals · must include · links: Frames · goals · must include · links\",\n      \"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.: Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\n      \"01_Splash: 01_Splash\",\n      \"Goal: Brand moment while the app opens.: Goal: Brand moment while the app opens.\",\n      \"MUST INCLUDE: MUST INCLUDE\",\n      \"• Brand: Logo_Travelin · tagline “Your Passport to Seamless Adventures!”: • Brand: Logo_Travelin · tagline “Your Passport to Seamless Adventures!”\",\n      \"LINKS: LINKS\",\n      \"→ after delay → 02_Get_Started: → after delay → 02_Get_Started\",\n      \"02_Get_Started: 02_Get_Started\",\n      \"Goal: Invite the traveller to start.: Goal: Invite the traveller to start.\",\n      \"MUST INCLUDE: MUST INCLUDE\",\n      \"• Action: “Your Journey Starts Here” (Icon_Plane) • Brand: Logo_Travelin • Headline: “Ready to explore beyond boundaries?” • Language: “English” (Icon_Chevron_Down) • Media: Photo_Aerial_Island: • Action: “Your Journey Starts Here” (Icon_Plane)\\n• Brand: Logo_Travelin\\n• Headline: “Ready to explore beyond boundaries?”\\n• Language: “English” (Icon_Chevron_Down)\\n• Media: Photo_Aerial_Island\",\n      \"LINKS: LINKS\",\n      \"→ Your Journey Starts Here → 03_Sign_In: → Your Journey Starts Here → 03_Sign_In\",\n      \"03_Sign_In: 03_Sign_In\",\n      \"Goal: Sign in with email / phone or a social account.: Goal: Sign in with email / phone or a social account.\",\n      \"MUST INCLUDE: MUST INCLUDE\",\n      \"• Actions: “Forgot password?” · “Sign In” · “Sign Up” • Copy: “Don’t have an account?” · “Discover the World with Every Sign In” · “Let’s Travel you in.” · “or sign in with” • Fields: “Email or Phone Number” · “Password” — both empty • Language: “English” (Icon_Chevron_Down) • Media: Photo_Hot_Air_Balloons • Social sign-in: Apple (Icon_Apple) · Facebook (Icon_Facebook) · Google (Icon_Google): • Actions: “Forgot password?” · “Sign In” · “Sign Up”\\n• Copy: “Don’t have an account?” · “Discover the World with Every Sign In” · “Let’s Travel you in.” · “or sign in with”\\n• Fields: “Email or Phone Number” · “Password” — both empty\\n• Language: “English” (Icon_Chevron_Down)\\n• Media: Photo_Hot_Air_Balloons\\n• Social sign-in: Apple (Icon_Apple) · Facebook (Icon_Facebook) · Google (Icon_Google)\",\n      \"LINKS: LINKS\",\n      \"→ Sign In → 04_Home: → Sign In → 04_Home\",\n      \"04_Home: 04_Home\",\n      \"Goal: See the upcoming trip and find the next journey.: Goal: See the upcoming trip and find the next journey.\",\n      \"MUST INCLUDE: MUST INCLUDE\",\n      \"• Account: “Hi, Paul” · 2,000 points (Icon_Coin) · avatar (Photo_Avatar_Cat) • Categories: Bus · Ferry · Flights · Hotels · Trains, each with its icon • Hotels: “Hotel recommendations for you” · See all · Swiss-Belhotel Rainforest Kuta (see DATA) • Journeys: “Journey together” · See all · Labengki Sombori · Mount Bromo · Sailing Komodo (see DATA) • Main navigation: tab bar Home / Orders / Deals / Account · current: Home • Search: “Where to go?” (Icon_Search) • Upcoming flight: ticket with status, date, route, times, duration, airline, class, stops and booking ID (see DATA): • Account: “Hi, Paul” · 2,000 points (Icon_Coin) · avatar (Photo_Avatar_Cat)\\n• Categories: Bus · Ferry · Flights · Hotels · Trains, each with its icon\\n• Hotels: “Hotel recommendations for you” · See all · Swiss-Belhotel Rainforest Kuta (see DATA)\\n• Journeys: “Journey together” · See all · Labengki Sombori · Mount Bromo · Sailing Komodo (see DATA)\\n• Main navigation: tab bar Home / Orders / Deals / Account · current: Home\\n• Search: “Where to go?” (Icon_Search)\\n• Upcoming flight: ticket with status, date, route, times, duration, airline, class, stops and booking ID (see DATA)\",\n      \"LINKS: LINKS\",\n      \"→ Home tab: current (no link): → Home tab: current (no link)\",\n      \"Navigation structure: Navigation structure\",\n      \"• Launch flow: 01_Splash → (after delay) 02_Get_Started → 03_Sign_In → 04_Home. • 04_Home has a bottom tab bar with 4 tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home), Orders (Icon_Ticket), Deals (Icon_Deals), Account (Icon_Account); current: Home. Only Home is part of this task — how the current tab looks is yours. • Entry only (no frame): language selector, Forgot password?, social sign-in, Sign Up, search, categories, See all, journey and hotel cards, the flight ticket, Orders, Deals, Account.: • Launch flow: 01_Splash → (after delay) 02_Get_Started → 03_Sign_In → 04_Home.\\n• 04_Home has a bottom tab bar with 4 tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home), Orders (Icon_Ticket), Deals (Icon_Deals), Account (Icon_Account); current: Home. Only Home is part of this task — how the current tab looks is yours.\\n• Entry only (no frame): language selector, Forgot password?, social sign-in, Sign Up, search, categories, See all, journey and hotel cards, the flight ticket, Orders, Deals, Account.\",\n      \"Fixed data & copy: Fixed data & copy\",\n      \"Use these values verbatim. Prices in USD.: Use these values verbatim. Prices in USD.\",\n      \"Account: Account\",\n      \"“Hi, Paul” · 2,000 points · Photo_Avatar_Cat: “Hi, Paul” · 2,000 points · Photo_Avatar_Cat\",\n      \"Upcoming flight: Upcoming flight\",\n      \"Status: Upcoming · 24 March 2024 CGK 05:30 → DPS 08:00 · 1h 30m Sentosa Air · Economy · Direct Booking ID: ZEEBAW (local times — Bali is 1 hour ahead of Jakarta): Status: Upcoming · 24 March 2024\\nCGK 05:30 → DPS 08:00 · 1h 30m\\nSentosa Air · Economy · Direct\\nBooking ID: ZEEBAW\\n(local times — Bali is 1 hour ahead of Jakarta)\",\n      \"Journey together (rating · price · duration): Journey together (rating · price · duration)\",\n      \"Mount Bromo · Volcano in East Java · ★ 4.9 · Start from $150/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Mount_Bromo) Labengki Sombori · Islands in Sulawesi · ★ 4.8 · Start from $250/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Labengki_Sombori) Sailing Komodo · Labuan Bajo · ★ 4.8 · Start from $200/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Sailing_Komodo): Mount Bromo · Volcano in East Java · ★ 4.9 · Start from $150/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Mount_Bromo)\\nLabengki Sombori · Islands in Sulawesi · ★ 4.8 · Start from $250/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Labengki_Sombori)\\nSailing Komodo · Labuan Bajo · ★ 4.8 · Start from $200/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Sailing_Komodo)\",\n      \"Hotel recommendations for you: Hotel recommendations for you\",\n      \"Swiss-Belhotel Rainforest Kuta · 4-star hotel Jl. Sunset Road No. 101, Kuta, Ba