n’s identity. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, surfaces and backgrounds, overlays on photos, semantic colors (status badges, rating, success, error, disabled), type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.: Fixed: the two brand colors and the typeface below — they carry Travelin’s identity. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, surfaces and backgrounds, overlays on photos, semantic colors (status badges, rating, success, error, disabled), type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.\",\n      \"Brand colors: Brand colors\",\n      \"Brand primary · teal: Brand primary · teal\",\n      \"#007A8C: #007A8C\",\n      \"Travelin’s main brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.: Travelin’s main brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\",\n      \"Brand secondary · forest green: Brand secondary · forest green\",\n      \"#336749: #336749\",\n      \"The second brand color (the “in” of the logo). Where and how much to use it is your decision.: The second brand color (the “in” of the logo). Where and how much to use it is your decision.\",\n      \"Typeface: Typeface\",\n      \"Aa Bb Cc 0123456789 $150/pax CGK → DPS: Aa Bb Cc 0123456789  $150/pax  CGK → DPS\",\n      \"Use Inter for all UI text (Regular / Medium / Semi Bold / Bold available). Sizes, weights and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale. The logo is an image in 04 · Media — do not retype it.: Use Inter for all UI text (Regular / Medium / Semi Bold / Bold available). Sizes, weights and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale. The logo is an image in 04 · Media — do not retype it.\",\n      \"Canvas: 430 × 932 (iPhone). Light mode only. 04_Home may scroll vertically.: Canvas: 430 × 932 (iPhone). Light mode only. 04_Home may scroll vertically.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"02 · Components 组件库\": {\n    \"id\": \"1:3\",\n    \"topNodes\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"1:24\",\n        \"name\": \"Components\",\n        \"type\": \"FRAME\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"textSample\": [\n      \"Components · Travelin (default states only): Components · Travelin (default states only)\",\n      \"Only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell are given. Every other state (pressed, focused, filled, disabled, selected…), the headers, the tab bar, the language selector and every business component (flight ticket, category items, journey cards, hotel cards, social sign-in buttons…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.: Only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell are given. Every other state (pressed, focused, filled, disabled, selected…), the headers, the tab bar, the language selector and every business component (flight ticket, category items, journey cards, hotel cards, social sign-in buttons…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\",\n      \"Button · default: Button · default\",\n      \"Sign In: Sign In\",\n      \"Text Field · default: Text Field · default\",\n      \"Email or Phone Number: Email or Phone Number\",\n      \"Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated): Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated)\",\n      \"iOS status bar and home indicator, 430 wide, transparent background. Place them on every frame; they are not part of your design (recolor the glyphs to white on dark photos if needed).: iOS status bar and home indicator, 430 wide, transparent background. Place them on every frame; they are not part of your design (recolor the glyphs to white on dark photos if needed).\",\n      \"9:41: 9:41\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"04 · Media 素材库\": {\n    \"id\": \"1:4\",\n    \"topNodes\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"4:4\",\n        \"name\": \"Media\",\n        \"type\": \"FRAME\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"textSample\": [\n      \"Media · Travelin: Media · Travelin\",\n      \"Copy these components into your own file and use them as instances. Crop, mask and size the photos as your layout needs; do not alter the logo. Icons are neutral (#1A1A1F) — recolor them to fit your color system. The Google / Apple / Facebook marks keep their brand colors.: Copy these components into your own file and use them as instances. Crop, mask and size the photos as your layout needs; do not alter the logo. Icons are neutral (#1A1A1F) — recolor them to fit your color system. The Google / Apple / Facebook marks keep their brand colors.\",\n      \"Logo: Logo\",\n      \"Logo_Travelin (white + forest green — place on teal or on photos): Logo_Travelin (white + forest green — place on teal or on photos)\",\n      \"Photos: Photos\",\n      \"Photo_Aerial_Island: Photo_Aerial_Island\",\n      \"Photo_Avatar_Cat: Photo_Avatar_Cat\",\n      \"Photo_Hot_Air_Balloons: Photo_Hot_Air_Balloons\",\n      \"Photo_Hotel_Room: Photo_Hotel_Room\",\n      \"Photo_Mount_Bromo: Photo_Mount_Bromo\",\n      \"Photo_Labengki_Sombori: Photo_Labengki_Sombori\",\n      \"Photo_Sailing_Komodo: Photo_Sailing_Komodo\",\n      \"Icons: Icons\",\n      \"Icon_Account: Icon_Account\",\n      \"Icon_Apple: Icon_Apple\",\n      \"Icon_Bus: Icon_Bus\",\n      \"Icon_Chevron_Down: Icon_Chevron_Down\",\n      \"Icon_Coin: Icon_Coin\",\n      \"Icon_Deals: Icon_Deals\",\n      \"Icon_Facebook: Icon_Facebook\",\n      \"Icon_Ferry: Icon_Ferry\",\n      \"Icon_Flight: Icon_Flight\",\n      \"Icon_Google: Icon_Google\",\n      \"Icon_Home: Icon_Home\",\n      \"Icon_Hotel: Icon_Hotel\",\n      \"Icon_Landing: Icon_Landing\",\n      \"Icon_Plane: Icon_Plane\",\n      \"Icon_Search: Icon_Search\",\n      \"Icon_Star: Icon_Star\",\n      \"Icon_Takeoff: Icon_Takeoff\",\n      \"Icon_Ticket: Icon_Ticket\",\n      \"Icon_Train: Icon_Train\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"03 · Workspace\": {\n    \"id\": \"6:2\",\n    \"topNodes\": [],\n    \"textSample\": []\n  }\n}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5f3b380f-f2d2-4f82-a745-b3675409a2af","uuid":"e292e59e-27c8-4711-a7ad-124efeaaa601","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:39:11.170Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"00 · Start Here 设计任务\": {\n    \"id\": \"0:1\",\n    \"topNodes\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"5:2\",\n        \"name\": \"Start Here · Brief\",\n        \"type\": \"FRAME\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"textSample\": [\n      \"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\n      \"Travelin — travel booking app: Travelin — travel booking app\",\n      \"Design the Travelin mobile app: open the app, start the journey, sign in, and land on a home screen with the upcoming flight, travel categories, recommended journeys and a recommended hotel. Canvas 430 × 932, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.: Design the Travelin mobile app: open the app, start the journey, sign in, and land on a home screen with the upcoming flight, travel categories, recommended journeys and a recommended hotel. Canvas 430 × 932, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\n      \"How to work: How to work\",\n      \"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, overlays on photos, status badge, rating, error / disabled), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the language selector, the tab bar and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, photos and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.: 1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, overlays on photos, status badge, rating, error / disabled), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the language selector, the tab bar and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use the logo, photos and icons from 04 · Media.\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\n      \"Frames · goals · must include · links: Frames · goals · must include · links\",\n      \"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.: Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\n      \"01_Splash: 01_Splash\",\n      \"Goal: Brand moment while the app opens.: Goal: Brand moment while the app opens.\",\n      \"MUST INCLUDE: MUST INCLUDE\",\n      \"• Brand: Logo_Travelin · tagline “